'''Plasmite''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading.  

== Appearance ==
Plasmite’s blade is a dark blue that has a galactic appearance, along with the edge having an icy look, but is a brighter blue. The guard is an indigo, and the handle is solid black. 

== Trivia ==
*[https://www.roblox.com/users/1568300/profile/ twinny4u92] is the creator of this knife.
*This knife, along with many other knives are from other Murder games.
*The description of this knife is: "And so a firey slush was born."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/161369368/SKIN-Plasmite-Knife Model created by Chris12902]</ref>

